Dear [Hiring Manager Name / Hiring Manager],

I am writing to express my strong interest in the [Position Title] role at [Company Name]. With over 20 years of progressive construction management experience and a demonstrated track record of successfully delivering projects valued from \$1M to \$200M, I am confident in my ability to provide immediate leadership and value to your organization.

Throughout my career, I have built a reputation for combining technical construction expertise with strong P&L management, team development, and collaborative stakeholder relations. Most recently at STS Construction, I held full project accountability for a \$12M, 58-unit multifamily development in Seattle, leading the on-site team while managing all aspects of budget, schedule, and client relationships. The project was delivered successfully with zero safety incidents and met all owner expectations for quality and timeline.

A defining achievement in my career was managing the \$40M Hyatt Place Hotel & Apartments project at Osborne Construction. Inheriting a schedule that was falling behind, I implemented the Last Planner System mid-project, creating an aggressive but achievable recovery plan through collaborative engagement with all trade partners. This approach resulted in substantial completion two months ahead of the revised schedule, even while successfully negotiating and executing 25 Construction Change Directives valued at over \$4M in the final four months.

I am particularly drawn to [Company Name] because of [specific reason: your reputation for excellence in X sector / your innovative approach to Y / your portfolio of landmark projects / your commitment to Z]. Your work on [specific project or initiative if known] aligns perfectly with my experience in [relevant sector/methodology], and I am excited about the opportunity to contribute to your continued success.

Key strengths I would bring to this role include:

• **Financial Management**: Proven P&L accountability on projects up to \$200M, with track record of delivering on-budget or under-budget through diligent cost control and forecasting

• **Team Leadership**: Experience building, mentoring, and leading high-performing project teams ranging from 5-20 field and office personnel

• **Client Relations**: Consistent success cultivating trust-based relationships with owners, resulting in repeat business and strong references across multiple sectors

• **Lean Implementation**: Demonstrated expertise implementing Last Planner System and Lean Construction principles to improve efficiency and collaboration

• **Multi-Sector Experience**: Diverse project background including high-rise, multifamily, hospitality, healthcare, historic renovation, and luxury residential

I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my leadership approach, technical expertise, and commitment to excellence can benefit [Company Name] and your clients. Thank you for your consideration.

Sincerely,
